      "applies_when": "route=FOLLOW_UP",
      "prompt_template": "**Prior Message Context**\n\nSince this is a follow-up, please provide:\n\n1. **When did you last communicate?** [e.g., '2 days ago']\n2. **What was the message type?** [e.g., 'connection request' or 'full message']\n3. **Message content:** [Paste your prior message]\n4. **Response received?** [Y/N]",
